<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9736] Public interface DiscoverySpiListener.onDiscovery returns private API class</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9736</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Public interface DiscoverySpiListener.onDiscovery returns&#160;IgniteInternalFuture of &apos;internal&apos; package.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should wrap internal future into IgniteFuture of&#160;public API.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13188116">IGNITE-9736</key>
            <summary>Public interface DiscoverySpiListener.onDiscovery returns private API class</summary>
